# Dietaibest Architecture & Patterns

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 App Router with TypeScript
- **Package Manager**: Bun (exclusive - never suggest npm/yarn)
- **Database**: Supabase (PostgreSQL) with Prisma ORM
- **UI Components**: Shadcn UI + Tailwind CSS
- **Authentication**: Supabase Auth + next-auth with Google OAuth
- **State Management**: React Context + server actions (minimal client state)

## Project Structure
```
src/
  actions/           # server actions
  app/
    (auth)/          # Authentication routes
    (protected-pages)/ # Authenticated user routes  
    (public-pages)/   # Public marketing pages
    api/             # API routes and server actions
  components/
    ui/              # Shared Shadcn UI components
    forms/           # Reusable form components
  lib/
    prisma.ts        # [lib/prisma.ts](mdc:lib/prisma.ts)
    utils.ts         # Utility functions
  hooks/             # Custom React hooks
  providers/         # React context providers
  types/             # TypeScript type definitions
```

## Key Architectural Decisions
- **Server Actions First**: All business logic via Next.js server actions
- **Prisma Types Only**: Never create local types, always derive from [prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma)
- **No Mock Data**: Unless explicitly requested, and must match Prisma types
- **Feature-First Structure**: Route-specific components in `_components` folders
- **API Response Format**: Always `{ data: ..., error: "Error message" }`
- **Error Handling**: All errors shown via Shadcn UI toast notifications

## External API Integrations
- **Edamam Recipe Search API**: Individual recipe nutritional analysis
- **Edamam Meal Planner API**: Automated meal plan generation
- **Browser-Use Cloud API**: Automated grocery shopping via AI agents
- **Supabase**: Authentication, database, real-time subscriptions

## Development Principles
- Less code, less complexity - production-grade MVP focus
- Server-driven UI with minimal client-side state
- Authentication checks required on ALL server actions
- Real-time macro recalculation for all nutrition changes
- Responsive design: mobile-first with tablet/desktop enhancements
